<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine April inflation 4.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine April inflation 4.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine annualised consumer inflation for April was 4.6 percent against March's 4.8 percent, the National Statistics Office said on Monday.</p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	   April 97  March 97  April 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change     +0.1     +0.8	 +0.4</p>
<p>    Yr-on-yr change	     +4.6     +4.8	+11.3</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)     236.1   235.8	225.8</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8109638 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
